<p>Your mind becomes more attuned to the Way, and is shielded from outside effects.</p><p>Increase confusion and silence immunities by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 34%, 43%, 49%, 55%</acronym> and Mental Save by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 9, 13, 16, 20.</acronym></p>